## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- **Python 3.10+** → [Download](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
- **Node.js 18+** → [Download](https://nodejs.org/)
- **Git** → [Download](https://git-scm.com/)
- **Gemini API Key** → [Get free key](https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey)

---

### 🔧 Backend Setup

```bash
# 1. Navigate to backend
cd backend

# 2. Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# 3. Activate venv
# Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate
# Mac/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate

# 4. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 5. Setup environment variables
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env and add your GEMINI_API_KEY

# 6. Initialize database
python database/init_db.py

# 7. Seed sample data
python database/seed_data.py

# 8. Run backend server
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
Backend will run at: http://localhost:8000
API Docs (Swagger): http://localhost:8000/docs

🎨 Frontend Setup
bash
# 1. Open a NEW terminal and navigate to frontend
cd frontend

# 2. Install dependencies
npm install

# 3. Setup environment variables
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env if needed (default API URL: http://localhost:8000)

# 4. Run frontend
npm run dev
Frontend will run at: http://localhost:5173

🔑 Environment Variables
Backend .env
env
# Gemini API
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Database
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./database/financial.db

# JWT
SECRET_KEY=your_super_secret_key_change_this
ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60

# Server
BACKEND_HOST=0.0.0.0
BACKEND_PORT=8000

# CORS
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173
Frontend .env
env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
📡 API Endpoints
🤖 Agent Endpoints
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/v1/agents/budget	Run Budget Agent
POST	/api/v1/agents/forecast	Run Forecast Agent
POST	/api/v1/agents/risk	Run Risk Agent
POST	/api/v1/agents/compliance	Run Compliance Agent
POST	/api/v1/agents/investment	Run Investment Agent
POST	/api/v1/orchestrate	🎼 Run ALL agents together
💾 Data Endpoints
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/v1/transactions	List all transactions
POST	/api/v1/transactions	Create transaction
GET	/api/v1/companies	List companies
GET	/api/v1/reports	List reports
POST	/api/v1/reports/generate	Generate report
🔐 Auth Endpoints
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/v1/auth/register	Register user
POST	/api/v1/auth/login	Login (JWT)
GET	/api/v1/auth/me	Current user
🧪 Sample Workflow
User Input: "Analyze Q4 2025 finances for TechCorp"

Orchestrator triggers:

Budget Agent → Allocates ₹50L across 6 departments

Forecast Agent → Predicts Q1 2026 revenue: ₹1.2Cr ± 8%

Risk Agent → Flags 3 anomalies (unusual transactions)

Compliance Agent → Reports 2 GST filing issues

Investment Agent → Suggests 4 investment options with ROI

Output: Unified report + dashboard visualizations ✅

