📌 Har Section Ka Matlab (Brief Explanation)
Section	Kya Ignore Karta Hai	Kyun
🐍 Python	__pycache__, .pyc, venv/	Compiled files + virtual env
🔐 Env	.env files	API keys safe rakhne ke liye! ⚠️
🗄️ Database	*.db, *.sqlite	Local data (repo mein nahi chahiye)
📊 Logs	*.log, logs/	Auto-generated, temporary
⚛️ Node/React	node_modules/, dist/, .vite/	Heavy folders, regenerate ho jaate hain
🧠 ML Models	*.pkl, *.h5, *.pt	Large files (100MB+)
📁 Temp	tmp/, uploads/	Temporary data
📄 Reports	*.pdf (generated)	Auto-generated reports
💻 IDE	.vscode/, .idea/	Personal editor settings
🖥️ OS	.DS_Store, Thumbs.db	OS-specific junk files
🧪 Testing	.pytest_cache/, .coverage	Test artifacts
🚀 Deployment	.vercel, .netlify	Deployment configs
📦 Locks	package-lock.json, yarn.lock	(Optional — kuch teams commit karti hain)
⚠️ IMPORTANT — ! Exception Ka Matlab
Lines jo ! se shuru hoti hain, wo exception hain — matlab "ignore na karo":

gitignore
!.env.example       # .env.example commit karo, .env nahi
!README.md          # README.md commit karo
!requirements.txt   # Dependencies list commit karo
