✅ Verify Karo Ki Sahi Kaam Kar Raha Hai
.gitignore banane ke baad, ye command chalao:

cmd
git status
Ye cheezein NAHI dikhni chahiye:

❌ venv/ ya .venv/

❌ node_modules/

❌ .env ⚠️ (ye sabse important!)

❌ __pycache__/

❌ *.db (database files)

❌ *.log (log files)

Ye cheezein DIKHNI chahiye:

✅ backend/

✅ frontend/

✅ README.md

✅ .gitignore

✅ .env.example

✅ requirements.txt

✅ package.json

🚨 Agar Galti Se .env Ya venv/ Add Ho Gaya Ho
Kabhi kabhi git add . chalane se pehle .gitignore nahi hota, aur .env ya venv/ stage ho jaate hain. Fix:

cmd
# Remove from staging (files delete nahi honge)
git rm -r --cached venv/
git rm -r --cached node_modules/
git rm --cached .env

# Ab wapas add karo
git add .
git commit -m "Add .gitignore and remove sensitive files"
git push
📋 Cheat Sheet: Kya Commit Karna, Kya Nahi
✅ Commit Karo	❌ Commit Nahi Karo
requirements.txt	venv/
package.json	node_modules/
.env.example	.env ⚠️
README.md	*.log
Source code (*.py, *.jsx)	__pycache__/
SQL schema files	*.db
Config templates	.vscode/
Tests	dist/, build/
Docs	*.pkl, *.h5
.gitignore	.DS_Store
